### 1. Register: creates the user and returns a token pair
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "AAA_petiad@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### 2. Login (email only)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "petia@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### 3. Current user: no body, access token in the header
GET http://localhost:8080/users/me
Authorization: Bearer

### 4. New access + refresh pair by refresh token (the old refresh token stops working)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": ""
}



### 5. Logout: revokes both tokens
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh_token}}"
}
